{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defy two empires and smash the duopoly in an adorable, quirky puzzle adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world dominated by <strong>Alphabarn</strong> and <strong>Omegamart</strong>, the twin supermarket overlords of <i>Duopolis</i>, a shopping cart awakens to find themselves abandoned, like so many others - destined to be destroyed and replaced. Teaming up with scrappy, an abandoned receipt, they begin their quest to <i>free</i> <i>all cartkind</i> from the devious plans of the evil duopoly and <strong>forge their own path to freedom.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >60 LEVELS OF COZY, TURN-BASED PUZZLE GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanning 5 different regions of Duopolis - each with their own quirks, characters and challenges. From the forest to the carpark, the supermarket to the sewers and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/a6c5a9c641ce125a5718e2fa6e205fd5.avif?t=1764721954\" width=598 height=263 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMASH THE DUOPOLY IN A CINEMATIC SATIRICAL ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow our two heroes\u2019 journey in a heartfelt, funny, satirical story about consumerism, duopoly and waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/40ab21aa9ab0b09540bb58c6bedb2bdf.avif?t=1764721954\" width=598 height=263 /></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL FEATURED LEVEL EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finished the story? Make your own! Create an infinite number of levels and challenge your friends with fiendish shopping cart puzzles of your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/1883880068982000a83c4bd9754edf5a.avif?t=1764721954\" width=598 height=263 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMING FOR CHANGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BraveCart isn\u2019t just a game. We want it to make a real impact for a sustainable future. To address this, we will be donating <strong>10% of every sale to charities</strong> that prioritise the sustainable treatment of corporate waste.<strong>\u00a0</strong>The game also features a \u201cTrolley Tracker\u201d, enabling players to report abandoned trolleys in real life whenever they find them, so they can be retrieved and reused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/0c7cce124108d502a76329b78dc21e40.avif?t=1764721954\" width=598 height=263 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3750760?t=1764721954","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/1688496777da8caf970607d99e80cf728e40f3e0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764721954","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/9dec16dea7b9f64dde01f1b1959668e2b026ba66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764721954","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/9dec16dea7b9f64dde01f1b1959668e2b026ba66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764721954","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defy two empires and smash the duopoly in an adorable, quirky puzzle adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world dominated by <strong>Alphabarn</strong> and <strong>Omegamart</strong>, the twin supermarket overlords of <i>Duopolis</i>, a shopping cart awakens to find themselves abandoned, like so many others - destined to be destroyed and replaced. Teaming up with scrappy, an abandoned receipt, they begin their quest to <i>free</i> <i>all cartkind</i> from the devious plans of the evil duopoly and <strong>forge their own path to freedom.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >60 LEVELS OF COZY, TURN-BASED PUZZLE GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanning 5 different regions of Duopolis - each with their own quirks, characters and challenges. From the forest to the carpark, the supermarket to the sewers and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/a6c5a9c641ce125a5718e2fa6e205fd5.avif?t=1764721954\" width=598 height=263 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMASH THE DUOPOLY IN A CINEMATIC SATIRICAL ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow our two heroes\u2019 journey in a heartfelt, funny, satirical story about consumerism, duopoly and waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/40ab21aa9ab0b09540bb58c6bedb2bdf.avif?t=1764721954\" width=598 height=263 /></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL FEATURED LEVEL EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finished the story? Make your own! Create an infinite number of levels and challenge your friends with fiendish shopping cart puzzles of your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/1883880068982000a83c4bd9754edf5a.avif?t=1764721954\" width=598 height=263 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMING FOR CHANGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BraveCart isn\u2019t just a game. We want it to make a real impact for a sustainable future. To address this, we will be donating <strong>10% of every sale to charities</strong> that prioritise the sustainable treatment of corporate waste.<strong>\u00a0</strong>The game also features a \u201cTrolley Tracker\u201d, enabling players to report abandoned trolleys in real life whenever they find them, so they can be retrieved and reused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/0c7cce124108d502a76329b78dc21e40.avif?t=1764721954\" width=598 height=263 /></span></p>","developers":["Hojo Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/0099cc1fe02f91ac8771f787de4eb88762344034/header.jpg?t=1764721954","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All content and code copyright Quad Goals Pty. Ltd.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra 10.13+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Mac integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Mac Sound C